       alert("This form must be printed on an A4 Size Paper. Please update your Printer Settings to ensure the correct printout of the form.\n\n" +
              "If applicable, open Internet Explorer, go to File -> Page Setup and change Page Size to A4,  Left, Right and Bottom Margins must be 0.75 inches, Top Margin must be 0.25 inches and all Headers & Footers must be set to empty.");
